Prism (PRISM - Platform-agnostic Reader Interface for Speech and Messages)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Kagura distributes an unmodified compiled binary of Prism as lib/prism.dll.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/ethindp/prism
  Author:    Ethin Probst
  Licence:   Mozilla Public Licence, version 2.0 (MPL-2.0)
  Revision:  83742ee415fc895567493c19c1a639ad3c092760

The full text of the Mozilla Public Licence 2.0 is available at:

  https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

Under section 3.2 of the MPL, the source code for Prism is available from the
upstream repository above at the exact revision listed. Kagura makes no
modifications to Prism; it links to nothing at build time and loads prism.dll
dynamically at runtime.

To rebuild that exact binary yourself, run scripts/build-prism.ps1, which checks
out the pinned revision above.

