Storm Framework / NS4 Modding API
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Kagura is a plugin for the Storm Framework and requires it at runtime, but does
not distribute or include any part of it. It must be installed separately.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/Sim-Sim2000/ns4moddingapi

